Subject: [PATCH 3/3] chore: bump @huggingface/transformers to 4.3.2

4.3.2, released on 27 Oct 2026, fixes from_pretrained never settling when an
.onnx_data download fails. EmbeddingGemma 2's q4 weights are stored in exactly
that kind of file (onnx/model_q4.onnx_data). In our test on Node 18, that
failure on 4.3.1 ended the server process: the library's rejection went
unhandled, so the catch in updateENV never saw it. On 4.3.2 the load fails with
the download's error, and the server logs it and stays up. The three older
models keep their quantized weights in one .onnx file, so this fix does not
reach them. Nothing else in the release notes touches how the embedder loads or
runs a model.

